      "message": "What if AP sends another host command before EC disables the interrupt? Shouldn\u0027t the interrupt be disabled before releasing the host-command BUSY status?\n\nAlso I am not sure how AP will handle the error response. Is that studied across all execution environments - Firmware, OS etc.?\n\nAlso in your analysis you mentioned Realtek ESPI driver clears the status bit at init. But we are seeing the issue in Boards with Realtek EC too (infact we are configuring EC_REBOOT_DELAY_MS in depthcharge to avoid this race condition).",
